{c: Verse 1}
[Gm] [F],        Sun le sada o mere sanam
[D#] [F],        Kehta hai dil khake yeh kasam
[Gm] [F],        Dekha zamee, dekha wo falak
[D#] [F],        Tumsa nahin dekha
[Gm] [F],        Teri aankhon ke jhalak dekhein,
[D#] [F],        ik zamaana hua
[Gm] [F],        Tere didar ka fariyadi
[D#] [Gm],        yeh deewana hua
[Gm] [F],        Eh mere humnawa, maine ki hai dua
[D#] [F] [Gm],        Sun raha yeh zami, sun raha aasmaan
[Gm],        Na main sikhwa karoon
[F],        Na sikayat karoon
[D#] [F] [Gm],        Tere khatir jiyun, tere khatir marun
